    "After a power cut this Mac starts up by itself and the node comes back without anyone logging in." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After a power cut this Mac starts up by itself and the node comes back without anyone logging in."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停電後、このMacは自動で起動し、ログインしなくてもノードが再開します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "정전이 나도 이 Mac은 저절로 켜지고, 로그인 없이 노드가 돌아와요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "断电后，此 Mac 会自动开机，节点无需登录即可恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停電後，此 Mac 會自動啟動，節點也會恢復，無須登入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a reboot the node — and this Mac's vote — come back by themselves, without anyone logging in, everywhere macOS allows it. A FileVault cold boot waits for one unlock first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After a reboot the node — and this Mac's vote — come back by themselves, without anyone logging in, everywhere macOS allows it. A FileVault cold boot waits for one unlock first."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "再起動後も、macOSが許す範囲でノードとこのMacの投票がログインなしで自動的に再開します。FileVaultが有効な状態で電源を入れた場合は、一度ロックを解除する必要があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "재시동한 뒤에도 노드와 이 Mac의 투표가 로그인 없이 저절로 돌아와요(macOS가 허락하는 범위에서). FileVault가 켜진 상태로 전원을 켜면 한 번 잠금을 풀어야 해요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重新启动后，在 macOS 允许的情况下，节点和此 Mac 的投票会自动恢复，无需登录。启用 FileVault 后开机，需要先解锁一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重新啟動後，節點與此 Mac 的投票會自動恢復，無須登入，前提是 macOS 允許。啟用 FileVault 時，開機後須先解鎖一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After fixing it, press Try Again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After fixing it, press Try Again."
