    "FileVault is on. After a power cut this Mac waits at the unlock screen; unlock it once and the node comes back by itself. macOS update restarts come back unlocked." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "FileVault is on. After a power cut this Mac waits at the unlock screen; unlock it once and the node comes back by itself. macOS update restarts come back unlocked."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "FileVaultがオンです。停電後は、このMacはロック解除画面で待機します。一度ロックを解除すると、ノードが自動で再開します。macOSのアップデートによる再起動では、ロック解除済みで戻ります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "FileVault가 켜져 있어요. 정전이 나면 이 Mac은 잠금 화면에서 기다려요 — 한 번 잠금을 풀면 노드가 저절로 돌아와요. macOS 업데이트로 재시동하면 잠금 없이 돌아와요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "FileVault 已开启。断电后，此 Mac 会停在解锁界面，解锁一次后节点会自动恢复。macOS 更新后的重启无需解锁。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "FileVault 已開啟。停電後，此 Mac 會停在解鎖畫面，解鎖一次後節點便會自動恢復。因 macOS 更新而重新啟動時，會以已解鎖狀態恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fetching and verifying app files…" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
