          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Join the network as a voting node?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Join the network as a voting node?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "投票ノードとしてネットワークに参加しますか？"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "투표 노드로 네트워크에 참여할까요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作为投票节点加入网络？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以投票節點加入網路？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Joining encrypts a DeviceCheck token to Pipln's registrar; only it can decrypt it and send it to Apple (USA), at registration and for daily checks. The registrar keeps the voting key, operator and beacon addresses, node ID and registration time without automatic expiry." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Joining encrypts a DeviceCheck token to Pipln's registrar; only it can decrypt it and send it to Apple (USA), at registration and for daily checks. The registrar keeps the voting key, operator and beacon addresses, node ID and registration time without automatic expiry."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "참여하면 DeviceCheck 토큰을 Pipln 등록기의 키로 암호화해요. 등록기만 복호화할 수 있고, 등록 때와 일일 확인 때 Apple(미국)에 보내요. 등록기는 투표키, 운영자·비콘 주소, 노드 ID와 등록 시각을 자동 만료 없이 보관해요."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "参加時にDeviceCheckトークンをPiplnの登録サービスの鍵で暗号化します。登録サービスだけが復号し、登録時と日次確認時にApple（米国）に送ります。投票鍵、運営者・ビーコンのアドレス、ノードIDと登録時刻を自動期限なしで保持します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加入时，DeviceCheck令牌使用Pipln注册服务的密钥加密。仅注册服务可解密，并在注册和每日检查时发送给Apple（美国）。注册服务保存投票密钥、运营者和信标地址、节点ID及注册时间，不设自动到期。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al unirte, el token de DeviceCheck se cifra con la clave del registrador de Pipln. Solo él puede descifrarlo y enviarlo a Apple (EE. UU.) al registrarte y en las verificaciones diarias. Conserva la clave de votación, direcciones del operador y la baliza, ID del nodo y hora de registro sin caducidad automática."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep %@ running. A signing Mac that goes offline hands its seat to the next one. It uses some network, CPU and power." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep %@ running. A signing Mac that goes offline hands its seat to the next one. It uses some network, CPU and power."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@を動かし続けてください。署名するMacが接続を切ると、次のMacに席を譲ります。通信、CPU、電力を少し使います。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@를 계속 켜 두세요. 서명하는 Mac이 꺼지면 자리가 다음 Mac에게 넘어가요. 네트워크, CPU, 전기를 조금 써요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请让 %@ 持续运行。签名的 Mac 离线后，会将席位交给下一台。它会消耗一些网络、CPU 和电力。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請讓 %@ 保持執行。簽署區塊的 Mac 離線後，其席位會交給下一部 Mac。這會使用一些網路、處理器與電力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep a share of the network's past." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep a share of the network's past."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ネットワークの過去の記録の一部を保管します。"
          }
