    "Peers and relays see connection IP addresses; RPC nodes see queried addresses. Cloudflare hosts the site and gateway; GitHub receives update requests made by Sparkle, including IP address and app version. Ask privacy@eastsea.xyz to delete removable service data; public chain copies cannot be recalled." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Peers and relays see connection IP addresses; RPC nodes see queried addresses. Cloudflare hosts the site and gateway; GitHub receives update requests made by Sparkle, including IP address and app version. Ask privacy@eastsea.xyz to delete removable service data; public chain copies cannot be recalled."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "피어와 릴레이는 연결 IP 주소를 보고, RPC 노드는 조회한 주소를 봐요. Cloudflare는 사이트와 게이트웨이를 호스팅하고, GitHub는 Sparkle 업데이트 요청의 IP 주소와 앱 버전을 받아요. 삭제 가능한 서비스 데이터는 privacy@eastsea.xyz로 요청하세요. 공개 체인 사본은 회수할 수 없어요."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ピアとリレーは接続IPアドレスを、RPCノードは照会したアドレスを確認できます。Cloudflareはサイトとゲートウェイをホストし、GitHubはIPアドレスとアプリのバージョンを含むSparkleの更新リクエストを受け取ります。削除可能なサービスデータはprivacy@eastsea.xyzに請求してください。公開チェーンのコピーは回収できません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对等节点和中继可看到连接IP地址，RPC节点可看到查询地址。Cloudflare托管网站和网关；GitHub收到Sparkle发出的更新请求，包括IP地址和应用版本。请向privacy@eastsea.xyz请求删除可移除的服务数据，公共链副本无法收回。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los pares y relés ven las IP de conexión; los nodos RPC ven las direcciones consultadas. Cloudflare aloja el sitio y la pasarela; GitHub recibe solicitudes de actualización de Sparkle con tu IP y versión de la app. Solicita borrar datos eliminables del servicio a privacy@eastsea.xyz; las copias públicas de la cadena no se pueden recuperar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pending: %@ %@ from %@… · ready %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pending: %@ %@ from %@… · ready %@"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "待機中：%3$@…から%1$@ %2$@ · %4$@から実行可能"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
