    },
    "Pick a folder for the block data. A “%@” folder is made inside it. The keys stay on this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick a folder for the block data. A “%@” folder is made inside it. The keys stay on this Mac."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ブロックデータを保存するフォルダを選んでください。その中に「%@」フォルダを作成します。キーはこのMacに残ります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "블록 데이터를 둘 폴더를 고르세요. 그 안에 ‘%@’ 폴더를 만들어요. 키는 이 Mac에 그대로 남아요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为区块数据选择文件夹，会在其中创建“%@”文件夹。密钥仍留在此 Mac 上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請選擇區塊資料的資料夾，裡面會建立「%@」資料夾。金鑰會留在此 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick a folder outside the current block data. The two locations cannot contain each other." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick a folder outside the current block data. The two locations cannot contain each other."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在のブロックデータの外にあるフォルダを選んでください。片方の保存先をもう片方の中に置くことはできません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "현재 블록 데이터 폴더 밖의 폴더를 선택하세요. 두 폴더는 서로를 포함할 수 없어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请选择当前区块数据文件夹之外的文件夹。两个位置不能互相包含。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請選擇目前區塊資料資料夾以外的資料夾。兩個位置不能互相包含。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Picked by the network for its long uptime. Keep the node on: stopping hands the seat to the next Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Picked by the network for its long uptime. Keep the node on: stopping hands the seat to the next Mac."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "長く稼働していたため、ネットワークに選ばれました。ノードを動かし続けてください。止めると次のMacに席を譲ります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "오래 켜져 있어서 네트워크에 뽑혔어요. 노드를 계속 켜 두세요. 멈추면 자리가 다음 Mac에게 넘어가요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网络因其长时间在线而选中它。请保持节点开启，停止会将席位交给下一台 Mac。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "因長時間保持連線而獲網路選中。請讓節點保持執行，停止後席位會交給下一部 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Planned for the future mainnet, which is not live: the rules may change before launch, and after it only by a committee-signed upgrade." : {
      "comment" : "legal-English-on-terms: TermsSheet resolves this body from reviewed en/ko; other screens use their app language.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Planned for the future mainnet, which is not live: the rules may change before launch, and after it only by a committee-signed upgrade."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "まだ稼働していないメインネットの予定ルールです。開始前には変わる場合があります。開始後は委員会が署名した更新でのみ変わります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "아직 시작하지 않은 메인넷을 위한 예정 규칙이에요. 시작 전에는 바뀔 수 있고, 시작 뒤에는 네트워크가 서명한 업그레이드로만 바뀌어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是为尚未上线的未来主网规划的规则。上线前可能调整，上线后只能通过委员会签名的升级更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是尚未啟用的主網預定規則。啟用前可能變更，啟用後只能透過委員會簽署的升級變更。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Planned mainnet rules" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Planned mainnet rules"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
