      }
    },
    "The network has not made a new block for a while, so there is nothing new to verify. The balance shown is the last one this device verified; a pause by itself does not move funds. It updates by itself when blocks resume." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The network has not made a new block for a while, so there is nothing new to verify. The balance shown is the last one this device verified; a pause by itself does not move funds. It updates by itself when blocks resume."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ネットワークにしばらく新しいブロックがないため、新たに検証するものがありません。表示中の残高は、このデバイスで最後に検証した値です。停止だけで資金は動きません。ブロックが再開すると自動で更新します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "네트워크에 한동안 새 블록이 없어서 새로 검증할 게 없어요. 보이는 잔액은 이 기기가 마지막으로 검증한 값이고, 멈춘다고 돈이 움직이지는 않아요. 블록이 다시 나오면 저절로 업데이트돼요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网络已有一段时间没有新区块，暂时没有新内容可验证。显示的余额是此设备上次验证的余额，暂停本身不会转移资金。恢复出块后会自动更新。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "網路已有一段時間沒有新區塊，因此沒有新資料可驗證。顯示的餘額是此裝置最後驗證的數值，暫停本身不會移動資金。區塊恢復後會自動更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network is busy: the fee right now is above the most this payment allows. It goes through once the fee comes down. If it still waits after 10 minutes it is cancelled, and no money leaves your wallet." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The network is busy: the fee right now is above the most this payment allows. It goes through once the fee comes down. If it still waits after 10 minutes it is cancelled, and no money leaves your wallet."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ネットワークが混み合い、手数料がこの支払いの上限を超えています。手数料が下がると処理されます。10分後も待機中ならキャンセルされ、ウォレットから資金は出ません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "네트워크가 붐벼 지금 수수료가 이 거래에 허용한 최대치보다 높아요. 내려가면 처리돼요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网络繁忙，当前手续费超过了此付款允许的最高金额。手续费降低后会处理。如果等待超过 10 分钟，会取消，钱包不会扣款。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "網路忙碌，目前手續費超出此付款的上限，下降後便會完成。若 10 分鐘後仍在等候，會取消，資金不會離開錢包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network is busy: the fee right now is above the most this payment allows. It may go through in about %@, when the fee comes down. If it has not come down within 10 minutes, it may not go through; you can send it again at the current fee." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The network is busy: the fee right now is above the most this payment allows. It may go through in about %@, when the fee comes down. If it has not come down within 10 minutes, it may not go through; you can send it again at the current fee."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ネットワークが混み合い、手数料がこの支払いの上限を超えています。約%@後に手数料が下がれば処理される場合があります。10分以内に下がらないと、処理されない場合があります。現在の手数料で再送できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "네트워크가 붐벼 지금 수수료가 이 거래에 허용한 최대치보다 높아요. 약 %@ 뒤 내려가면 처리돼요. 10분 안에 내려가지 않으면 처리되지 않을 수 있고, 그때는 새 가격으로 다시 보낼 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网络繁忙，当前手续费超过了此付款允许的最高金额。约 %@ 后，手续费降低时可能处理。如果 10 分钟内未降低，付款可能无法处理；你可以按当前手续费重新发送。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "網路忙碌，目前手續費超出此付款的上限。若手續費下降，約 %@ 後可能完成。若 10 分鐘內未下降，可能無法完成；你可用目前手續費再次傳送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network is busy: the fee right now is above the most this payment allows. Waiting for the fee to come down. If it is still waiting after 10 minutes, you may need to send it again at the current fee." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The network is busy: the fee right now is above the most this payment allows. Waiting for the fee to come down. If it is still waiting after 10 minutes, you may need to send it again at the current fee."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
