    "This site is asking which address this wallet controls. Saying yes shows it **%@** — the address itself, not your key, and not your balances." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This site is asking which address this wallet controls. Saying yes shows it **%@** — the address itself, not your key, and not your balances."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このサイトがウォレットのアドレスを問い合わせています。許可すると**%@**を表示します。アドレスだけで、キーや残高は表示しません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 사이트가 이 지갑의 주소를 묻고 있어요. 허락하면 주소 **%@** 하나만 보여 줘요. 키나 잔액은 보여 주지 않아요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此网站想知道这个钱包的地址。允许后，它只能看到地址 **%@**，无法看到密钥或余额。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此網站正在詢問錢包控制的地址。允許後只會顯示 **%@** 地址，不會顯示金鑰或餘額。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This token is not on the wallet’s trusted list" : {
      "localizations" : {
